# Amazon SDE Portfolio

A modern, responsive portfolio website for an Amazon Software Development Engineer featuring dark/light theme toggle, AWS skills showcase, project highlights, and professional timeline.

## Features

- 🌓 Dark/Light theme toggle with localStorage persistence
- 📱 Fully responsive design (mobile-first approach)
- ⚡ Performance optimized (LCP < 2.5s)
- ♿ Accessible (WCAG AA compliant)
- 📧 Contact form with Formspree integration
- 🎯 SEO optimized with meta tags
- 🎨 Modern CSS with BEM methodology and CSS variables
- 🚀 Deployed to Vercel

## Sections

- Hero
- About
- AWS Skills
- Projects (4 featured projects)
- Timeline (Education & Work Experience)
- Contact

## Tech Stack

- HTML5 Semantic Elements
- CSS3 (CSS Variables, BEM, Flexbox/Grid)
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Formspree (for contact form)
- Vercel (for deployment)

## Setup

1. Clone the repository
2. Open `index.html` in your browser
3. For development, you can use any static server

## Deployment

This site is deployed to Vercel. To deploy your own version:

1. Fork this repository
2. Connect to Vercel
3. Vercel will automatically detect and deploy the site

